{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31574","headline":"湘阴江亭却寄友人 · 李羣玉","name":"湘阴江亭却寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘岸初晴淑景迟，风光正是客愁时。\n幽花暮落骚人浦，芳草春深帝子祠。\n往事隔年如过梦，旧游回首谩劳思。\n烟波自此扁舟去，小酌文园杳未期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}